# Digilent Basys 3 (Xilinx XC7A35T-1CPG236C), three pins of it.
#
# PROVENANCE: the pin names are transcribed from
# `examples/soc/board/basys3.rcf`, which transcribes Digilent's published
# `Basys-3-Master.xdc`. V17 and V16 are slide switches 0 and 1, U16 is
# LED 0. The rest of the board is listed in that file.
#
# On 2026-09-24 a bitstream built with these three pins ran on a Basys 3
# and drove LED 0 from the two switches. LVCMOS33 is the only IO standard
# any of this has been tried with on a part.
set_io -io_standard LVCMOS33 sw0 V17
set_io -io_standard LVCMOS33 sw1 V16
set_io -io_standard LVCMOS33 led U16
